  "sn11.8:1.1": "",
  "sn11.8:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena Bhagavā divā vihāragato hoti paṭisallīno || || 3. ",
  "sn11.8:1.3": "Atha kho Sakko devānam indo Verocano ca asurindo yena Bhagavā ten-upasaṅkamiṃsu || upasaṅkamitvā paccekadvārabāham nissāya aṭṭhaṃsu || || 4. ",
  "sn11.8:1.4": "Atha kho Verocano asurindo Bhagavato santike imaṃ gātham abhāsi || || ",
  "sn11.8:2.1": "Vāyameth-eva puriso || ",
  "sn11.8:2.2": "yāva atthassa nippadā || ",
  "sn11.8:2.3": "nippannasobhaṇo attho || ",
  "sn11.8:2.4": "Verocanavaco idan ti || || 5. ",
  "sn11.8:3.1": "Vāyameth-eva puriso || ",
  "sn11.8:3.2": "yāva atthassa nippadā || ",
  "sn11.8:3.3": "nippannasobhaṇo attho || ",
  "sn11.8:3.4": "khantyā bhiyyo na vijjatī ti || || 6. ",
  "sn11.8:4.1": "Sabbe sattā atthajātā || ",
  "sn11.8:4.2": "tattha tattha yathārahaṃ || ",
  "sn11.8:4.3": "saṃyogaparamā tveva || ",
  "sn11.8:4.4": "sambhogā sabbapāṇinaṃ || ",
  "sn11.8:4.5": "nippannasobhino atthā || ",
  "sn11.8:4.6": "Verocanavaco idan ti || || 7. ",
  "sn11.8:5.1": "Sabbe sattā atthajātā || ",
  "sn11.8:5.2": "tattha tattha yathārahaṃ || ",
  "sn11.8:5.3": "saṃyogaparamā tveva || ",
  "sn11.8:5.4": "sambhogā sabbapāṇinaṃ || ",
  "sn11.8:5.5": "nippannasobhino atthā || ",
  "sn11.8:5.6": "khantyā bhiyyo na vijjatī ti || 1. Sāvatthi || || 2. "
